(4) Appoint and fix the duties of such officers, agents, and employees as the officer deems necessary to carry out the purposes of this article; and
(5) Delegate any of the Officer's functions and powers under the ordinance to such officers and agents as the Officer may designate.
(Code 2006, § 42-136)
State Law reference— Similar provisions, O.C.G.A. § 41-2-11.

